### ridesharing.api.http - Test endpoints for the Ridesharing module

### 1. Find nearby riders (User)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ride-sharing/find-rider
Authorization: {{user}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pickLatitude": 40.7128,
  "pickLongitude": -74.0060,
  "pickupAddress": "123 Main St, New York, NY",
  "destinationLat": 40.7580,
  "destinationLong": -73.9855,
  "destinationAddress": "Times Square, New York, NY",
  "paywith": "Cash",
  "orderType": "Ridesharing"
}

### 2. Send ride request to a specific rider (User)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ride-sharing/send-request
Authorization: {{user}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "riderId": "69b12864ef93861f711e2882",
  "pickupLatitude": 40.7128,
  "pickupLongitude": -74.0060,
  "pickupAddress": "123 Main St, New York, NY",
  "destinationLat": 40.7580,
  "destinationLong": -73.9855,
  "destinationAddress": "Times Square, New York, NY",
  "userDistanceKm": 2.5,
  "riderDistanceKm": 1.2,
  "etaMinutes": 10,
  "cost": 12.50,
  "payWith": "Cash",
  "orderType": "Ridesharing"
}

### 3. Get my ride requests (Rider)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ride-sharing/my-ride-requests
Authorization: {{rider}}

### 4. Get current active ride (User)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ride-sharing/current-ride
Authorization: {{user}}

### 5. Cancel a ride (User or Rider)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ride-sharing/cancel-ride/67a1b2c3d4e5f67890abcdef
Authorization: {{user}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cancelReason": "Changed my mind"
}

### 6. Start a ride (Rider)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ride-sharing/start-ride/67a1b2c3d4e5f67890abcdef
Authorization: {{rider}}

### 7. End a ride (Rider)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ride-sharing/end-ride/67a1b2c3d4e5f67890abcdef
Authorization: {{rider}}

### 8. Pay with BePay (User)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ride-sharing/bepay-payment/67a1b2c3d4e5f67890abcdef
Authorization: {{user}}

### 9. Pay with Cash (User)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ride-sharing/cash-payment/67a1b2c3d4e5f67890abcdef
Authorization: {{user}}

### 10. Pay with Card (User)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ride-sharing/card-payment/67a1b2c3d4e5f67890abcdef
Authorization: {{user}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentMethodId": "pm_card_visa"
}

### 11. Initiate PayPal payment (User)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ride-sharing/paypal-payment/67a1b2c3d4e5f67890abcdef
Authorization: {{user}}

### 12. Get ridesharing details by ID (any authenticated user)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ride-sharing/6a7d5809197b0af260881bf1
Authorization: {{user}}

### 13. Get my ride history (User)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ride-sharing/my/ride-history
Authorization: {{user}}

### 14. Get my wallet history (Rider)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ride-sharing/my/wallet-history
Authorization: {{rider}}
